{"id":230618,"name":"B14 - G10, G-Cribs","headline":"The Poolside Swanky Studio @ G Cribs","summary":"This cozy 1 bedroom studio is located in G-cribs with free pool access.","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis cozy 1 bedroom studio is located in G-cribs with free pool access.\r\n\r\nThe 1 bedroom studio comes with an open plan fully equipped kitchen, 1 full bathroom.\r\n\r\nIt also features a 55 inch smart TV with Airplay and cable channels, a Nespresso machine, kettle and a microwave.  \r\n\r\nThe styling is made with a modish and calming taste to ensure guests have a wonderful and relaxing experience. \r\n\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire apartment\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions.  Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\nG Cribs is the comfort zone for those who want to discover more.\r\nEach unit receives full access to all facilities and services G Cribs provides.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nFree outdoor parking is available. \r\nTuktuks are available to take you anywhere in El Gouna.\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that smoking is not allowed inside the apartment. A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n Egyptian and Arab couples are required to provide marriage certificate, according to the Egyptian law. Foreign nationalities do not need a marriage certificate."},"city":"El Gouna","capacity_of_guests":2,"number_of_bedrooms":1,"number_of_beds":2,"number_of_bathrooms":1,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"G Cribs","location_address2":"","location_lat":"27.394351","location_lng":"33.643111406082","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental