0618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5403891,"review":"Smooth experience and great customer service","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5411329,"review":"Great stay","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5415627,"review":"مضيف مميز جدا انصحكم بالتعامل معه لقد واجهتني مشكلة عند تسجيل الوصول وهي انقطاع المياه علي الرغم انها لم تكون بسبب Xuru Stays بل كانت عن طريق شركة أوراسكوم وبالرغم من ذلك تم حل المشكلة في اقل من ساعه وقدمو لي هديه اعتذارا علي الرغم انها لم تكن بسببهم \nشكراً زور ❤️🌹","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5424044,"review":"My stay was good, the place is clean and provides the daily needs from fridge, stove, kettle, microwave, it has fast internet connection\n\nSome notes to consider is that the pool is cold-ish (if you're planning on visiting in the winter) but is cleaned daily\n\nThe G-Cribs isn't near anything and you need a car or tuktuk to move around, this means if you needed anything urgent in the middle of the night like medicine maybe, you'll be stranded\n\nThe G-Cribs itself is very clean and relaxing, there was no noise. A lot of mosquitos if you leave the terrace open with no mosquito net\n\nThe wardrobe smelled funny but I didn't have the need to open it\n\nThey provided 2 large bottles of water as a compliment which was very nice\n\nAll in all my experience was very good, would recommend if you need to relax, work or in your honeymoon and need a compound to yourself.","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5456101,"review":"I had a great stay here! check in was very quick and easy. the place was super cozy and peaceful. also the host is super helpful and great to work with :) couch and bed were super comfy and the patio was lovely (if you're lucky, maybe a kitty or two will stop by the patio and say hi to you). thank you for the great stay we will definitely be back soon!","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z"},{"id":5483789,"review":".","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5553308,"review":"V good","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5553688,"review":"Positive:\nCozy and has everything u need\n\nNegative:\nIt wasn’t cleaned properly, specially the dishes! The shelves were very dusty which means it hasn’t been cleaned","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5601067,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nThe property was very dirty with a bad smell from the bathroom, uncounted mosquitos every where.\nSwimming pools in the compound so dirty","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5658253,"review":"I had a wonderful stay! The apartment was exactly as described. Communication was smooth and very responsive\nI would love to come back again!","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5743005,"review":"The place matched the photos and descriptions, the checkin and checkout rules were clear. The place is quiet and peaceful. The host was very responsive even when i faced a hard situation during my stay they were prompt to handle the situation. Overall my stay was pleasant.","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5762258,"review":"great place clean and quick response for any inquiry of course five stars and highly recommended...","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5771755,"review":"Very responsive host and organized.\nHighly recommended","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z"},{"id":5783061,"review":"The accommodations were spotless, comfortable, and beautifully maintained, exceeding my expectations. I highly recommend this place to anyone looking for comfort, excellent service, and a memorable experience. I will definitely be returning!","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5786604,"review":"Amazing place and clean","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5791331,"review":"Good place","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5800180,"review":"Un super séjour ! L’hôte a été très accueillant, disponible et attentif à chaque détail. Le logement est parfaitement conforme à la description, propre et chaleureux. Je recommande vivement et je reviendrai avec plaisir !","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5803390,"review":"Friendly host","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5828102,"review":"Amazing place","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5832933,"review":"The place is great and cosy. Perfect for a couple. It is right by the pool. The host was very helpful and responded quickly to all my messages and sent a team to help deal with any issues we had immediately.","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5842945,"review":"Great place for a getaway vacation.","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5849527,"review":"Exactly as pictures, very cozy and peaceful. The host was very responsive and followed up with us every now and then, will be coming back again.","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5860897,"review":"Everything was smooth and good","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5864842,"review":"Y","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5893040,"review":"Thanks for everything","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5910580,"review":"The place was spotless when we arrived, super easy check in and the host was extremely fast with response, it was very private, perfect for couples. I definitely recommend, totally worth it!","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z"},{"id":5922735,"review":"perfect","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":6009028,"review":"The place was cosy and clean. Perfect for a solo get away. The host was great too.","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6023183,"review":"Everything was just as described. Thank you!","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6102513,"review":"Place is very cosy i really loved it there, it’s very good for some alone peaceful time , xuru stays team is always helpful i recommend them  xx","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6110685,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6111951,"review":".","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6152852,"review":"I stayed for 8 days, It was a great experience, Xuru stays were very professional and helped make my vacation time peaceful and fun, they were very responsive and clear on the instructions, I even had a complimentary cleaning service (This is not a hotel) which I found it very nice, will definitely use Xuru stays for my vacation again.","rental_id":230618,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}